# SystemManager's profile hook. Before it, a consumer could time only systems
# it wrote itself, so puzzle's 518-line profiler measured 149 of theirs and
# zero of afterhours', and a per-draw regression in the library had to be found
# by bisect rather than read off a profile.
#
# The timings move every run, so nothing here asserts a number: the baseline is
# the stopped state, and the check is that rows appear at all once started.
# Every name in them belongs to a system this screen did not write.

goto_screen system_profile_lab
wait 0.4
validate_screen system_profile_lab

click_ui spl_toggle
wait 0.8
assert_ui spl_row_0 h=28
assert_ui spl_row_1 h=28
assert_within_parents

click_ui spl_toggle
wait 0.3
